WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.076 --> 00:00:13.546
"I can't wait to try rock climbing!"

2
00:00:13.886 --> 00:00:14.666
Mason said.

3
00:00:14.687 --> 00:00:17.509
"It's going to be so much fun!"

4
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.031
Olivia bit her lip.

5
00:00:20.051 --> 00:00:22.012
"Um, yeah.

6
00:00:22.293 --> 00:00:23.093
I can't wait either."

7
00:00:24.735 --> 00:00:25.615
Mason laughed.

8
00:00:26.816 --> 00:00:28.518
"You're not going to like rock climbing.

9
00:00:29.539 --> 00:00:31.140
You're afraid of heights, Olivia!"

10
00:00:32.608 --> 00:00:33.489
"I am not!"

11
00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:36.472
Olivia folded her arms across her chest.

12
00:00:37.773 --> 00:00:41.996
She was terrified, but of course, she didn't want her brother to know that.

13
00:00:42.016 --> 00:00:47.301
"We're here," Mom said as she pulled into the parking lot.

14
00:00:49.023 --> 00:00:50.164
"You two have fun."

15
00:00:52.005 --> 00:00:53.727
Olivia and Mason went inside.

16
00:00:56.169 --> 00:00:59.232
An instructor asked the siblings for their shoe sizes.

17
00:01:00.832 --> 00:01:03.633
She grabbed a pair of rock-climbing shoes for each of them.

18
00:01:05.054 --> 00:01:09.156
After that she helped them put on harnesses and took them into the gym.

19
00:01:12.097 --> 00:01:13.137
Olivia gasped.

20
00:01:14.438 --> 00:01:17.159
The walls were even taller than she'd expected.

21
00:01:18.259 --> 00:01:21.561
They were dotted with colorful objects that looked like rocks.

22
00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.621
"What are those?"

23
00:01:24.102 --> 00:01:24.642
she asked.

24
00:01:25.802 --> 00:01:29.504
"You use them to climb up the walls," the instructor said.

25
00:01:31.044 --> 00:01:33.005
"Different colors mark different routes.

26
00:01:33.645 --> 00:01:35.886
Some routes are more difficult than others."

27
00:01:35.906 --> 00:01:38.047
"What do we do first?"

28
00:01:38.507 --> 00:01:39.588
Mason blurted out.

29
00:01:39.608 --> 00:01:41.269
"I'm ready to start!"

30
00:01:42.929 --> 00:01:46.191
The instructor gave a short demonstration on how to climb.

31
00:01:52.874 --> 00:01:57.096
of our walls have devices that control the rope as you climb," she said.

32
00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.902
"Just hook the rope onto your harness and climb.

33
00:02:02.163 --> 00:02:05.465
When you lean back, the device will lower you slowly."

34
00:02:05.485 --> 00:02:13.992
"Awesome!" Mason ran to a wall, hooked a rope onto his harness, and started to climb.

35
00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:17.614
He looked down at his sister.

36
00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:20.176
"I'm going to beat you to the top!"

37
00:02:21.577 --> 00:02:22.538
"Stop bragging!"

38
00:02:22.918 --> 00:02:25.180
Olivia said as she stepped up to the wall.

39
00:02:26.544 --> 00:02:28.465
She clipped the rope onto her harness.

40
00:02:29.886 --> 00:02:33.469
Carefully she placed her foot on a rock and got onto the wall.

41
00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.692
When she felt ready, she climbed a bit higher.

42
00:02:42.375 --> 00:02:45.477
She looked up at her brother, who was already halfway up the wall.

43
00:02:45.497 --> 00:02:51.001
"I can do this," she told herself.

44
00:02:51.021 --> 00:02:52.502
"I'm not scared."

45
00:02:53.662 --> 00:02:57.249
Each time Olivia got a little higher, she took a deep breath.

46
00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:02.733
Then, when she felt comfortable, she climbed some more.

47
00:03:05.595 --> 00:03:09.238
She felt all of her muscles straining, but she enjoyed the feeling.

48
00:03:10.419 --> 00:03:13.761
In fact, she was starting to feel a lot less scared.

49
00:03:15.722 --> 00:03:17.984
Soon she heard a bell ring from above.

50
00:03:18.004 --> 00:03:20.786
"I'm at the top!

51
00:03:21.266 --> 00:03:22.027
I won!"

52
00:03:22.467 --> 00:03:23.288
Mason yelled.

53
00:03:24.268 --> 00:03:26.791
He looked down at Olivia with a sly grin.

54
00:03:28.692 --> 00:03:30.534
Suddenly his face went pale.

55
00:03:30.554 --> 00:03:34.418
"Are you okay?"

56
00:03:34.858 --> 00:03:35.699
Olivia asked.

57
00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.021
Mason was silent.

58
00:03:38.422 --> 00:03:41.585
His entire body was now flat against the wall.

59
00:03:41.605 --> 00:03:46.029
"He went up too fast," Olivia thought.

60
00:03:46.049 --> 00:03:48.712
"He didn't realize how high he'd climbed."

61
00:03:51.868 --> 00:03:54.429
Olivia continued up and was soon next to him.

62
00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.090
Mason looked terrified.

63
00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:00.612
"H-how come you don't seem s-scared?"

64
00:04:00.892 --> 00:04:01.932
he asked his sister.

65
00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:03.653
Olivia grinned.

66
00:04:03.673 --> 00:04:06.434
"I went up just a little bit at a time.

67
00:04:08.555 --> 00:04:10.496
That way, I got used to the height slowly.

68
00:04:11.736 --> 00:04:12.537
Now lean back.

69
00:04:12.917 --> 00:04:14.357
You'll be back on the floor soon."

70
00:04:18.179 --> 00:04:20.280
Olivia led her brother down the wall.

71
00:04:23.616 --> 00:04:25.859
When Mason was ready, they climbed up again.

72
00:04:29.724 --> 00:04:31.687
This time he was a bit nervous.

73
00:04:32.869 --> 00:04:35.031
But Olivia wasn't scared at all!
